# U36: AnointDisplayItem (ItemsTab.lua:3081-3118) with anointItem and AppendAnointTooltip
# (L3011-3066). A custom rare amulet: "Anoint..." opens the popup with U28's NotableDBControl
# (`self` is the AnointItemsTab adapter: anointItem, AppendAnointTooltip, the socket viewer's
# AddNodeName); the save button reads "Remove Force of Darkness" (normalise copied the equipped
# amulet's anoint, CopyAnointsAndEldritchImplicits; its x and width are functions of the label);
# search "heart", hover two rows (the row tooltip: AddNodeName, the node lines, AppendAnointTooltip
# through the calc), select the first (the label "Anoint ..."), hover the button (its tooltip:
# AppendAnointTooltip), click it (SetDisplayItem of the anointed copy). Reopen: the label reads
# "Remove ..." (getAnoint); hover it (anointing nothing) and click it (the anoint removed).
#! u36-expect Anoint Item
#! u36-expect Remove Force of Darkness
#! u36-expect Remove
